@startuml
title Local Playback
actor User
participant UI
participant PlaybackService
participant QMediaPlayer

User -> UI : select local track
UI -> PlaybackService : play_file(path)
PlaybackService -> QMediaPlayer : setMedia(local file)
PlaybackService -> QMediaPlayer : play
QMediaPlayer --> UI : positionChanged/durationChanged
User -> UI : pause, seek, stop
UI -> PlaybackService : control command
PlaybackService -> QMediaPlayer : pause/setPosition/stop
@enduml
